1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,179 --> 00:01:55,784
=Episode 18=

21
00:02:10,010 --> 00:02:10,609
Hello,

22
00:02:11,130 --> 00:02:11,850
Harry's mom.

23
00:02:24,609 --> 00:02:25,250
Satisfied now?

24
00:02:25,929 --> 00:02:26,449
Are you?

25
00:02:29,690 --> 00:02:30,250
Excuse me,

26
00:02:30,929 --> 00:02:31,889
another coffee, please.

27
00:02:40,769 --> 00:02:41,250
Tell me.

28
00:02:42,889 --> 00:02:43,850
Why call me here?

29
00:02:45,489 --> 00:02:46,649
It's simple.

30
00:02:47,609 --> 00:02:48,329
Work with me.

31
00:02:50,690 --> 00:02:51,130
Come on,

32
00:02:51,130 --> 00:02:52,049
aren't you being

33
00:02:52,049 --> 00:02:52,810
ridiculous?

34
00:02:53,290 --> 00:02:53,929
Take your son

35
00:02:53,929 --> 00:02:54,970
away from here.

36
00:02:56,209 --> 00:02:57,329
What if that's the offer?

37
00:02:57,970 --> 00:02:58,609
I'm listening.

38
00:02:59,250 --> 00:02:59,970
I know Han Guang

39
00:02:59,970 --> 00:03:01,729
will transfer the money to you.

40
00:03:01,729 --> 00:03:02,889
All I need to know now

41
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,410
is the overseas account

42
00:03:04,410 --> 00:03:05,209
he's using

43
00:03:05,209 --> 00:03:06,489
to funnel company assets.

44
00:03:07,169 --> 00:03:08,130
What overseas account?

45
00:03:09,010 --> 00:03:09,649
I don't know.

46
00:03:12,570 --> 00:03:13,649
Does Harry know?

47
00:03:14,530 --> 00:03:15,690
Or rather,

48
00:03:16,729 --> 00:03:17,810
do you want him to know?

49
00:03:19,690 --> 00:03:20,290
What about you?

50
00:03:21,010 --> 00:03:21,690
What did you

51
00:03:21,690 --> 00:03:22,370
tell Haoyu?

52
00:03:24,889 --> 00:03:25,570
That meal

53
00:03:25,570 --> 00:03:26,970
only let Harry know

54
00:03:27,329 --> 00:03:28,410
that his mother

55
00:03:28,929 --> 00:03:30,010
was a maid in our house.

56
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:31,769
After another meal,

57
00:03:32,609 --> 00:03:33,329
I can't guarantee

58
00:03:33,329 --> 00:03:34,209
what else he'll know.

59
00:03:34,810 --> 00:03:35,690
Betraying Han Guang

60
00:03:37,010 --> 00:03:37,889
would just expose me,

61
00:03:37,889 --> 00:03:38,530
wouldn't it?

62
00:03:40,570 --> 00:03:41,769
My only target is Han Guang.

63
00:03:42,370 --> 00:03:43,290
And taking him down

64
00:03:43,609 --> 00:03:44,449
benefits you too.

65
00:03:45,929 --> 00:03:47,090
Once he falls,

66
00:03:48,169 --> 00:03:49,489
the only one Di Liren can rely on

67
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:51,290
will be you.

68
00:03:52,410 --> 00:03:53,570
When that happens,

69
00:03:54,049 --> 00:03:55,329
taking them abroad

70
00:03:55,609 --> 00:03:56,290
will be a breeze.

71
00:03:59,329 --> 00:04:00,370
No need to answer now.

72
00:04:01,049 --> 00:04:01,970
Take time to think,

73
00:04:03,769 --> 00:04:05,370
but don't keep me waiting too long.

74
00:04:06,489 --> 00:04:07,370
Chances don't wait.

75
00:04:13,649 --> 00:04:14,169
A word?

76
00:04:24,449 --> 00:04:25,529
What are you doing here?

77
00:04:26,170 --> 00:04:27,329
I have a meeting now.

78
00:04:28,010 --> 00:04:29,130
I'll see you tonight, okay?

79
00:04:29,409 --> 00:04:30,010
You say that

80
00:04:30,449 --> 00:04:31,250
to Meng and my mom

81
00:04:31,250 --> 00:04:32,010
a lot, don't you?

82
00:04:32,010 --> 00:04:32,930
What are you saying?

83
00:04:32,930 --> 00:04:33,649
Isn't it true?

84
00:04:33,930 --> 00:04:34,849
I'll just quote you.

85
00:04:35,329 --> 00:04:35,849
You said,

86
00:04:36,104 --> 00:04:37,050
"Methods don't matter,

87
00:04:37,050 --> 00:04:38,050
achieving the goal does."

88
00:04:38,050 --> 00:04:39,050
Playing both sides.

89
00:04:40,570 --> 00:04:41,810
Such profound wisdom.

90
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:44,529
Stay out of this.

91
00:04:45,289 --> 00:04:45,969
I'll handle it.

92
00:04:46,649 --> 00:04:47,209
Handle who?

93
00:04:47,649 --> 00:04:48,089
My mom

94
00:04:48,409 --> 00:04:48,969
or Meng?

95
00:04:50,529 --> 00:04:50,889
Dad,

96
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:52,810
you can only choose one of them.

97
00:04:53,529 --> 00:04:54,370
If you choose Meng,

98
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:55,969
I'll live with Mom.

99
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:57,209
Stop dragging her down.

100
00:04:58,130 --> 00:04:58,849
If you choose Mom,

101
00:04:59,730 --> 00:05:00,490
then divorce Meng.

102
00:05:01,370 --> 00:05:02,376
Stop wasting her time.

103
00:05:02,769 --> 00:05:03,170
Fine.

104
00:05:03,570 --> 00:05:04,130
I get it.

105
00:05:05,570 --> 00:05:06,769
Tell me right now.

106
00:05:07,089 --> 00:05:07,649
If you don't,

107
00:05:07,690 --> 00:05:08,744
I won't let you go.

108
00:05:08,849 --> 00:05:09,289
And I'll

109
00:05:09,449 --> 00:05:10,889
call you "Dad" at Jiali every day.

110
00:05:13,370 --> 00:05:14,289
Do you think the choice

111
00:05:14,329 --> 00:05:15,170
is mine?

112
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:17,209
I'm the one being chosen.

113
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:18,170
Besides,

114
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:20,370
it's not a choice.

115
00:05:21,329 --> 00:05:22,130
Not that simple.

116
00:05:23,769 --> 00:05:24,449
Then why

117
00:05:24,449 --> 00:05:25,690
did you make such a mistake?

118
00:05:25,969 --> 00:05:27,370
Why did you hurt Mom,

119
00:05:27,570 --> 00:05:28,930
and still fail to cherish Meng?

120
00:05:29,889 --> 00:05:31,289
I understand you defending

121
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:32,610
your mom,

122
00:05:34,329 --> 00:05:35,849
but why are you

123
00:05:36,649 --> 00:05:37,610
looking out for Yu Meng?

124
00:05:38,010 --> 00:05:39,050
Meng is my friend.

125
00:05:39,329 --> 00:05:40,250
She deserves better.

126
00:05:41,170 --> 00:05:42,010
If not for you,

127
00:05:43,089 --> 00:05:44,329
she could find someone better.

128
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:46,050
She could have met

129
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:47,730
someone faithful and committed.

130
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:53,370
Feelings are complicated.

131
00:05:54,010 --> 00:05:55,250
At your age,

132
00:05:55,690 --> 00:05:56,776
you wouldn't understand.

133
00:05:57,329 --> 00:05:57,810
So,

134
00:05:58,889 --> 00:06:00,329
I completely understand

135
00:06:00,370 --> 00:06:01,250
and accept

136
00:06:01,449 --> 00:06:02,370
your emotions now.

137
00:06:03,649 --> 00:06:04,610
But this is between me,

138
00:06:04,610 --> 00:06:05,130
your mom,

139
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:06,170
and Yu Meng.

140
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:07,769
We'll handle it ourselves.

141
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:09,050
I promise

142
00:06:09,810 --> 00:06:11,130
there will be an end to this.

143
00:06:12,649 --> 00:06:13,170
But now,

144
00:06:13,170 --> 00:06:14,170
I really gotta go.

145
00:06:43,490 --> 00:06:44,810
(Take your son away from here.)

146
00:06:45,329 --> 00:06:46,490
What if that's the offer?

147
00:06:56,449 --> 00:06:57,529
(Does Harry know?)

148
00:06:58,170 --> 00:06:59,010
Or rather,

149
00:07:00,130 --> 00:07:01,449
do you want him to know?

150
00:07:02,209 --> 00:07:03,449
(Once he falls,)

151
00:07:03,464 --> 00:07:04,889
(the only one Di Liren can rely on)

152
00:07:04,889 --> 00:07:05,649
(will be you.)

153
00:07:06,280 --> 00:07:07,130
(When that happens,)

154
00:07:07,130 --> 00:07:08,089
(taking them abroad)

155
00:07:08,649 --> 00:07:09,409
(will be a breeze.)

156
00:07:16,930 --> 00:07:17,370
Hello?

157
00:07:17,730 --> 00:07:19,050
How does Haoyu seem?

158
00:07:19,409 --> 00:07:19,889
Is he okay?

159
00:07:20,730 --> 00:07:21,250
He's fine.

160
00:07:22,490 --> 00:07:23,409
After what you said,

161
00:07:24,209 --> 00:07:25,289
what could he brood about?

162
00:07:25,730 --> 00:07:27,289
Okay, get some rest.

163
00:07:27,889 --> 00:07:28,769
Don't hang up yet.

164
00:07:29,130 --> 00:07:29,640
What's up?

165
00:07:30,209 --> 00:07:31,250
If Han Guang goes down,

166
00:07:32,529 --> 00:07:33,289
what will you do?

167
00:07:33,969 --> 00:07:34,969
I'll take you and Haoyu

168
00:07:35,050 --> 00:07:35,930
abroad right away,

169
00:07:36,089 --> 00:07:36,810
totally unscathed.

170
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:40,130
Why ask all of a sudden?

171
00:07:40,449 --> 00:07:41,320
Is everything okay?

172
00:07:41,730 --> 00:07:42,250
It's nothing.

173
00:07:43,010 --> 00:07:44,050
I'm tired. Going to sleep.

174
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:39,289
(Yu Meng)
10:00 AM.

175
00:08:39,730 --> 00:08:40,850
I'll give you what you want.

176
00:08:48,027 --> 00:08:51,208
(Ideal Experimental School)

177
00:08:53,610 --> 00:08:54,450
Come on, Chestnut.

178
00:08:54,649 --> 00:08:55,649
Have a good day.

179
00:08:55,730 --> 00:08:57,010
Just like Mom,

180
00:08:57,330 --> 00:08:59,130
I'm only happy on vacation.

181
00:09:00,090 --> 00:09:01,210
Look at you.

182
00:09:02,289 --> 00:09:03,090
Go on.

183
00:09:03,689 --> 00:09:04,250
Chestnut,

184
00:09:05,010 --> 00:09:05,730
a little sugar

185
00:09:05,850 --> 00:09:06,696
fixes everything.

186
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:09,689
Uncle Kang made

187
00:09:09,689 --> 00:09:10,809
my day again.

188
00:09:12,370 --> 00:09:13,409
I'll put it away. Careful.

189
00:09:15,610 --> 00:09:16,090
All right.

190
00:09:16,250 --> 00:09:16,730
Take it.

191
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:17,970
Bye, Kang.

192
00:09:18,169 --> 00:09:18,929
Bye, Mom.

193
00:09:19,049 --> 00:09:20,090
Okay. Bye-bye. Be careful.

194
00:09:20,610 --> 00:09:21,210
Okay.

195
00:09:21,450 --> 00:09:22,049
Don't run!

196
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:23,130
Didn't you say

197
00:09:23,130 --> 00:09:24,689
you wouldn't waste a single second?

198
00:09:24,689 --> 00:09:25,250
You've already

199
00:09:25,250 --> 00:09:26,250
wasted a minute.

200
00:09:26,730 --> 00:09:28,210
Can't I come see Chestnut?

201
00:09:28,450 --> 00:09:29,169
Sorry,

202
00:09:29,370 --> 00:09:30,569
I don't want you so involved

203
00:09:30,610 --> 00:09:31,490
in my daughter's life.

204
00:09:31,889 --> 00:09:32,330
Goodbye.

205
00:09:33,610 --> 00:09:34,090
Liu Zi.

206
00:09:37,289 --> 00:09:37,730
Wait, Mom.

207
00:09:37,730 --> 00:09:38,409
How could you

208
00:09:38,409 --> 00:09:39,496
dress my boy in this?

209
00:09:40,169 --> 00:09:41,049
Change it.

210
00:09:41,769 --> 00:09:42,210
Yeah.

211
00:09:42,970 --> 00:09:43,889
The one behind is fine.

212
00:09:43,929 --> 00:09:44,610
That color works.

213
00:09:44,929 --> 00:09:45,529
Yeah, okay.

214
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:48,090
Right, that's better.

215
00:09:48,529 --> 00:09:49,250
Okay.

216
00:09:57,450 --> 00:09:58,130
Why are you here?

217
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:03,330
Where are you going?

218
00:10:03,649 --> 00:10:04,584
Give it to me.

219
00:10:05,250 --> 00:10:06,088
Give it back!

220
00:10:10,139 --> 00:10:11,048
(Nassau Island Asset
Management Co., Ltd.)

221
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:16,809
No wonder you mentioned

222
00:10:16,850 --> 00:10:18,049
Han Guang suddenly last night.

223
00:10:18,689 --> 00:10:19,610
Who are you

224
00:10:19,730 --> 00:10:20,610
giving this to?

225
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:21,850
Yu Meng?

226
00:10:22,370 --> 00:10:23,090
Giving it to her

227
00:10:23,090 --> 00:10:24,169
can end all this sooner,

228
00:10:24,529 --> 00:10:25,130
and Haoyu won't

229
00:10:25,130 --> 00:10:26,049
know the truth.

230
00:10:26,824 --> 00:10:27,529
Isn't it nice?

231
00:10:38,090 --> 00:10:39,169
I'll pretend this

232
00:10:39,169 --> 00:10:39,970
never happened.

233
00:10:40,090 --> 00:10:41,250
You had a lapse in judgment,

234
00:10:42,289 --> 00:10:43,090
but I don't want

235
00:10:43,130 --> 00:10:44,330
to see it happen again.

236
00:10:44,370 --> 00:10:44,929
Why?

237
00:10:46,049 --> 00:10:46,889
For Haoyu,

238
00:10:47,450 --> 00:10:48,490
I'd risk anything.

239
00:10:48,529 --> 00:10:49,649
You're too naive.

240
00:10:51,049 --> 00:10:52,090
Yu Meng's sweet talk

241
00:10:52,090 --> 00:10:53,250
had you spinning.

242
00:10:53,610 --> 00:10:55,130
Even if she can take down Han Guang,

243
00:10:55,769 --> 00:10:56,970
do you think she'll spare you?

244
00:10:57,169 --> 00:10:58,330
If she loses to him,

245
00:10:58,409 --> 00:10:59,130
and he finds out

246
00:10:59,130 --> 00:10:59,970
you backstabbed him,

247
00:11:00,049 --> 00:11:01,130
with his power,

248
00:11:01,250 --> 00:11:02,730
he'll make you suffer a lot.

249
00:11:02,889 --> 00:11:03,769
Suffer a lot?

250
00:11:04,169 --> 00:11:05,490
I've already been through it.

251
00:11:06,450 --> 00:11:07,850
Haven't I already been suffering?

252
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:11,809
I don't want you jumping

253
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:13,049
from one fire into another.

254
00:11:13,289 --> 00:11:14,130
When you do that,

255
00:11:14,169 --> 00:11:15,370
do you know how it hurts me?

256
00:11:15,649 --> 00:11:17,090
I was almost stabbed in the back

257
00:11:17,210 --> 00:11:18,490
by the person I love most.

258
00:11:19,169 --> 00:11:20,010
Believe it or not,

259
00:11:21,529 --> 00:11:22,850
I did this for your own good.

260
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:25,169
You can't let go of power and greed,

261
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:26,450
so I had to give you a push.

262
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:27,809
If it's for my own good,

263
00:11:28,210 --> 00:11:29,809
stand firmly by my side,

264
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:31,169
not Yu Meng's.

265
00:11:31,929 --> 00:11:33,330
We are the family here.

266
00:11:36,251 --> 00:11:37,288
(Yu Meng)

267
00:11:52,284 --> 00:11:52,929
(Lu Hui)

268
00:11:52,929 --> 00:11:54,049
We were one step away.

269
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:55,330
Yesterday, she already

270
00:11:55,330 --> 00:11:56,049
agreed to meet me.

271
00:11:58,970 --> 00:12:00,090
Plans change all the time.

272
00:12:00,490 --> 00:12:01,250
Since Lu Hui

273
00:12:01,250 --> 00:12:02,490
is about to rat out Han Guang,

274
00:12:02,569 --> 00:12:03,970
it proves this path is viable.

275
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:05,730
We'll just find another way.

276
00:12:08,850 --> 00:12:09,649
So annoying.

277
00:12:17,649 --> 00:12:18,370
Hello, Mom.

278
00:12:19,169 --> 00:12:19,649
Why

279
00:12:19,649 --> 00:12:20,529
video call me now?

280
00:12:21,130 --> 00:12:21,649
Meng,

281
00:12:22,090 --> 00:12:23,250
look!

282
00:12:23,809 --> 00:12:25,610
Isn't the view gorgeous?

283
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:26,730
In a bit,

284
00:12:26,730 --> 00:12:27,970
when the sun sets,

285
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:28,970
it's even prettier.

286
00:12:29,210 --> 00:12:29,610
Look.

287
00:12:30,130 --> 00:12:31,409
Let me show you.

288
00:12:32,049 --> 00:12:32,730
Take a look.

289
00:12:34,450 --> 00:12:35,569
The scenery is nice.

290
00:12:36,289 --> 00:12:36,929
Who is with you?

291
00:12:37,409 --> 00:12:37,769
Look.

292
00:12:38,010 --> 00:12:39,250
Long time no see.

293
00:12:39,450 --> 00:12:40,649
I'm keeping your mom company.

294
00:12:44,450 --> 00:12:45,210
Why are you there?

295
00:12:47,730 --> 00:12:48,409
Well,

296
00:12:49,250 --> 00:12:50,490
I come here often.

297
00:12:50,529 --> 00:12:51,610
I came here several times

298
00:12:51,889 --> 00:12:52,809
with my parents

299
00:12:52,809 --> 00:12:54,210
and yours.

300
00:12:54,529 --> 00:12:55,529
Now that

301
00:12:56,370 --> 00:12:57,809
she's staying here long-term,

302
00:12:58,130 --> 00:12:59,049
I'll visit her

303
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:01,169
more often.

304
00:13:02,010 --> 00:13:03,409
I can visit my mom myself.

305
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:04,490
Save your visit.

306
00:13:05,529 --> 00:13:06,649
Now, please give the phone

307
00:13:06,649 --> 00:13:07,689
right back to my mom.

308
00:13:08,169 --> 00:13:08,649
Thank you.

309
00:13:09,090 --> 00:13:09,610
All right.

310
00:13:09,889 --> 00:13:10,210
Here.

311
00:13:17,529 --> 00:13:18,730
(Di Liren)
Yu Meng has a lawyer with her.

312
00:13:19,049 --> 00:13:19,889
Just scare her a bit.

313
00:13:20,210 --> 00:13:21,769
No real threats.

314
00:13:21,889 --> 00:13:22,889
Or they'll use it.

315
00:13:23,289 --> 00:13:24,529
(I know what I'm doing.)

316
00:13:24,610 --> 00:13:25,769
(Just teaching her a lesson)

317
00:13:25,929 --> 00:13:26,569
(to remind her)

318
00:13:26,610 --> 00:13:28,169
(to keep her hands off my accounts.)

319
00:13:34,409 --> 00:13:34,970
Hello?

320
00:13:35,368 --> 00:13:35,970
(Keep Quiet)

321
00:13:35,970 --> 00:13:36,769
I want to upgrade

322
00:13:36,769 --> 00:13:37,769
my mom's security level.

323
00:13:38,169 --> 00:13:39,210
Except for me, no one

324
00:13:39,210 --> 00:13:40,289
can approach her.

325
00:13:40,450 --> 00:13:41,250
At all times,

326
00:13:41,370 --> 00:13:42,769
ensure her personal safety.

327
00:14:50,010 --> 00:14:50,450
(Dad,)

328
00:14:50,689 --> 00:14:51,809
(you felt unwell lately.)

329
00:14:51,809 --> 00:14:52,425
(What's wrong?)

330
00:14:52,425 --> 00:14:53,490
(I have trouble sleeping.)

331
00:14:53,490 --> 00:14:54,210
(I can hear)

332
00:14:54,210 --> 00:14:55,450
(all this loud noise in my ears)

333
00:14:55,450 --> 00:14:56,730
(when I close my eyes.)

334
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:57,210
(It's been)

335
00:14:57,210 --> 00:14:57,850
(over a month.)

336
00:14:57,850 --> 00:14:58,450
(He's)

337
00:14:58,450 --> 00:14:59,049
(getting worse.)

338
00:14:59,049 --> 00:15:00,289
(His sleep is getting poorer.)

339
00:15:00,289 --> 00:15:01,370
- (This time, the patient)
- (Insisting on being discharged.)

340
00:15:01,450 --> 00:15:02,569
(had another stroke)

341
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:03,752
(after a brain hemorrhage.)

342
00:15:05,010 --> 00:15:06,169
(Legally speaking,)

343
00:15:06,529 --> 00:15:07,569
(can he be deemed)

344
00:15:07,610 --> 00:15:08,929
(to lack civil capacity?)

345
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:09,769
(Pretty much.)

346
00:15:10,689 --> 00:15:11,250
Meng,

347
00:15:12,370 --> 00:15:13,010
what's wrong?

348
00:15:19,970 --> 00:15:20,610
Let me ask you.

349
00:15:22,569 --> 00:15:23,730
When did my dad start saying

350
00:15:23,730 --> 00:15:24,569
he couldn't sleep?

351
00:15:24,712 --> 00:15:25,970
It's in the record.

352
00:15:25,970 --> 00:15:26,569
Let me check.

353
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:34,929
Here.

354
00:15:35,610 --> 00:15:37,569
Three weeks ago, the first time.

355
00:15:37,970 --> 00:15:38,970
Three weeks ago...

356
00:15:41,210 --> 00:15:41,769
Show me

357
00:15:41,769 --> 00:15:43,049
your handover log with Lu Hui.

358
00:15:47,771 --> 00:15:48,584
(Nurse Handover Log)

359
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:53,384
(Lu Hui)

360
00:15:56,450 --> 00:15:58,130
Lu Hui came three weeks ago, right?

361
00:15:58,450 --> 00:15:58,850
Yes.

362
00:15:59,370 --> 00:16:01,289
It seems only after Ms. Hui came back

363
00:16:01,330 --> 00:16:02,769
that your dad told her his insomnia.

364
00:16:14,529 --> 00:16:15,490
You called?

365
00:16:20,889 --> 00:16:21,809
When did you put this?

366
00:16:22,169 --> 00:16:22,889
What is this?

367
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:24,289
A speaker

368
00:16:24,850 --> 00:16:26,490
that emits low-frequency interference.

369
00:16:26,689 --> 00:16:27,250
This thing

370
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,730
has been stuck under my dad's bed,

371
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:30,130
constantly disrupting his sleep

372
00:16:30,130 --> 00:16:30,850
and rest.

373
00:16:32,289 --> 00:16:33,130
Listen for yourself.

374
00:16:33,370 --> 00:16:34,689
Unless you get really close,

375
00:16:34,850 --> 00:16:35,850
you can hardly hear it.

376
00:16:36,490 --> 00:16:38,130
But to a patient,

377
00:16:38,370 --> 00:16:39,529
it is like sticking a needle

378
00:16:39,569 --> 00:16:40,730
straight into his head.

379
00:16:42,370 --> 00:16:44,200
Where'd you get it?

380
00:16:46,289 --> 00:16:46,809
Lu Hui,

381
00:16:48,250 --> 00:16:49,250
the camera in the room

382
00:16:49,289 --> 00:16:50,049
caught everything.

383
00:16:51,090 --> 00:16:52,450
You planted this.

384
00:16:52,929 --> 00:16:54,049
What's it to me?

385
00:16:54,889 --> 00:16:55,970
Besides, no private cameras

386
00:16:55,970 --> 00:16:56,730
in the ward.

387
00:16:56,769 --> 00:16:58,370
The TV in there has a built-in camera,

388
00:16:58,370 --> 00:16:59,049
you know?

389
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:00,450
It caught every detail.

390
00:17:01,289 --> 00:17:01,970
Lu Hui,

391
00:17:02,409 --> 00:17:03,210
do you realize

392
00:17:03,210 --> 00:17:03,929
what you're doing?

393
00:17:04,329 --> 00:17:05,329
You're committing murder!

394
00:17:05,329 --> 00:17:05,730
You know?

395
00:17:05,730 --> 00:17:06,809
Have you lost your minds?

396
00:17:10,730 --> 00:17:11,210
Fine.

397
00:17:12,369 --> 00:17:13,768
Don't admit it, huh?

398
00:17:14,730 --> 00:17:15,529
I'll call the cops.

399
00:17:15,650 --> 00:17:16,289
Go ahead.

400
00:17:16,410 --> 00:17:17,490
Even if it was on camera,

401
00:17:17,529 --> 00:17:18,250
it only proves

402
00:17:18,289 --> 00:17:19,289
I was caring for him

403
00:17:19,329 --> 00:17:20,250
and cleaning corners.

404
00:17:20,529 --> 00:17:21,490
You're mistaken.

405
00:17:21,609 --> 00:17:22,769
And it was just

406
00:17:22,809 --> 00:17:23,970
an unknown item in the room.

407
00:17:24,690 --> 00:17:25,569
What crime can it be?

408
00:17:25,890 --> 00:17:26,769
Still playing dumb?

409
00:17:27,569 --> 00:17:28,529
You're facing

410
00:17:28,529 --> 00:17:29,210
