891
00:35:49,930 --> 00:35:51,490
Could my mom help you find your son?

892
00:35:53,970 --> 00:35:55,049
Let's be realistic.

893
00:35:56,129 --> 00:35:57,450
You don't want Harry to know

894
00:35:57,970 --> 00:35:59,049
what you and Di Liren

895
00:35:59,049 --> 00:35:59,930
have been up to.

896
00:36:00,529 --> 00:36:01,290
I can help you.

897
00:36:01,729 --> 00:36:02,290
Tell me.

898
00:36:03,370 --> 00:36:04,249
Since you came to me,

899
00:36:05,089 --> 00:36:06,249
you must already have a plan.

900
00:36:06,490 --> 00:36:07,810
Ms. Xu and her husband

901
00:36:08,049 --> 00:36:09,169
divorced long ago.

902
00:36:09,569 --> 00:36:10,770
They just kept it quiet.

903
00:36:12,290 --> 00:36:13,290
And

904
00:36:13,609 --> 00:36:14,729
at a tennis court

905
00:36:14,770 --> 00:36:15,689
she frequents lately,

906
00:36:16,249 --> 00:36:17,089
from what I know,

907
00:36:17,569 --> 00:36:18,490
Ms. Xu paid her coach

908
00:36:19,010 --> 00:36:20,249
500 thousand yuan

909
00:36:20,249 --> 00:36:20,850
all at once.

910
00:36:21,450 --> 00:36:22,770
If your information is true,

911
00:36:22,850 --> 00:36:23,890
I can solve Ms. Xu's

912
00:36:24,010 --> 00:36:24,850
funding issue for you

913
00:36:24,850 --> 00:36:26,049
in one move.

914
00:36:26,569 --> 00:36:27,450
In one move?

915
00:36:28,609 --> 00:36:29,450
Why should I, though?

916
00:36:30,770 --> 00:36:31,689
Why should I help you,

917
00:36:31,890 --> 00:36:32,770
and why should I trust

918
00:36:32,810 --> 00:36:33,850
you'll keep your word?

919
00:36:38,450 --> 00:36:39,049
Di Liren

920
00:36:39,049 --> 00:36:40,089
hasn't told you yet, huh?

921
00:36:40,850 --> 00:36:42,010
I've asked for a divorce.

922
00:36:42,689 --> 00:36:43,890
Don't you want to know

923
00:36:44,010 --> 00:36:44,930
what he said?

924
00:36:45,370 --> 00:36:46,729
Haven't you always wished

925
00:36:47,290 --> 00:36:48,689
I'd divorce Di Liren?

926
00:36:49,169 --> 00:36:49,970
That was before.

927
00:36:50,209 --> 00:36:51,569
He said he won't agree.

928
00:36:51,569 --> 00:36:52,729
I just want you to know

929
00:36:52,970 --> 00:36:54,249
that all my energy now

930
00:36:54,649 --> 00:36:55,729
goes toward taking him on

931
00:36:55,770 --> 00:36:56,872
and getting a divorce.

932
00:36:56,872 --> 00:36:58,290
I have no time and no reason

933
00:36:58,290 --> 00:36:58,930
to deceive you.

934
00:36:59,410 --> 00:36:59,930
The divorce

935
00:36:59,930 --> 00:37:01,169
is between the two of you.

936
00:37:01,970 --> 00:37:03,656
I don't care. Nor do I want to know.

937
00:37:04,330 --> 00:37:04,970
From now on,

938
00:37:04,970 --> 00:37:06,049
anything about Di Liren

939
00:37:06,290 --> 00:37:07,609
has nothing to do with me.

940
00:37:18,410 --> 00:37:19,850
Even though Lu Hui turned me down,

941
00:37:20,049 --> 00:37:21,450
I bet she'll help me

942
00:37:22,049 --> 00:37:22,770
this time.

943
00:37:22,810 --> 00:37:23,410
That confident?

944
00:37:23,450 --> 00:37:24,569
Because I can see

945
00:37:24,649 --> 00:37:25,930
how much Harry means to her.

946
00:37:26,010 --> 00:37:27,729
You really changed your mind

947
00:37:27,970 --> 00:37:29,450
and dragged Harry into this?

948
00:37:29,729 --> 00:37:31,089
Not really.

949
00:37:31,290 --> 00:37:32,410
I just want to use Harry

950
00:37:32,450 --> 00:37:33,370
to remind Lu Hui

951
00:37:33,569 --> 00:37:34,930
who matters most to her

952
00:37:35,249 --> 00:37:36,850
and who her real family is,

953
00:37:37,290 --> 00:37:38,609
to make her see Di Liren clearly.

954
00:37:38,850 --> 00:37:39,490
Fine.

955
00:37:39,850 --> 00:37:41,450
After all, involving Harry

956
00:37:42,010 --> 00:37:42,770
brings him closer

957
00:37:42,770 --> 00:37:43,689
to you as well.

958
00:37:45,209 --> 00:37:45,529
What?

959
00:37:47,689 --> 00:37:48,249
Nothing.

960
00:37:49,290 --> 00:37:49,930
Sounds like

961
00:37:49,970 --> 00:37:51,370
Di Liren and Lu Hui

962
00:37:51,609 --> 00:37:52,290
are falling out.

963
00:37:52,609 --> 00:37:53,569
All he cares

964
00:37:53,569 --> 00:37:54,290
is profit.

965
00:37:55,330 --> 00:37:56,209
A fallout is nothing

966
00:37:56,209 --> 00:37:56,890
special.

967
00:37:59,209 --> 00:38:00,410
But for me,

968
00:38:00,569 --> 00:38:01,249
ever since

969
00:38:01,249 --> 00:38:02,569
I found that black box,

970
00:38:02,729 --> 00:38:03,810
shares,

971
00:38:04,010 --> 00:38:05,209
money, and profits

972
00:38:05,249 --> 00:38:06,609
don't matter as much anymore.

973
00:38:07,649 --> 00:38:08,529
I can't lose my dad

974
00:38:08,529 --> 00:38:09,209
over such things.

975
00:38:09,689 --> 00:38:10,729
Through this divorce,

976
00:38:10,890 --> 00:38:12,010
you've really matured a lot.

977
00:38:13,169 --> 00:38:14,010
A surprise for you.

978
00:38:14,810 --> 00:38:15,529
Look who's here.

979
00:38:18,129 --> 00:38:18,810
(Please Keep Quiet)
Meng.

980
00:38:19,089 --> 00:38:19,649
(Press Button for Assistance)
Mom?

981
00:38:20,890 --> 00:38:22,330
You're finally back!

982
00:38:24,010 --> 00:38:25,249
Look how worn out you are.

983
00:38:25,450 --> 00:38:26,850
Look how much weight you've lost.

984
00:38:27,970 --> 00:38:29,410
I won't leave ever again.

985
00:38:29,609 --> 00:38:31,010
I'll stay with you and your dad.

986
00:38:32,010 --> 00:38:33,529
You're not leaving again?

987
00:38:33,529 --> 00:38:34,290
What about

988
00:38:34,290 --> 00:38:35,330
Master Xiuyuan's classes?

989
00:38:37,569 --> 00:38:38,770
He's a fraud!

990
00:38:39,089 --> 00:38:40,649
He talks like a saint, a vegetarian.

991
00:38:41,010 --> 00:38:42,089
No smoking, no drinking,

992
00:38:42,249 --> 00:38:43,609
dressed poorly

993
00:38:43,649 --> 00:38:45,129
like some ascetic monk,

994
00:38:45,330 --> 00:38:46,330
but in private,

995
00:38:46,850 --> 00:38:48,890
he binges on meat, alcohol,
and cigarettes!

996
00:38:51,410 --> 00:38:52,770
Wasn't that you

997
00:38:52,810 --> 00:38:53,930
beside that scammer

998
00:38:55,049 --> 00:38:56,089
that day?

999
00:38:57,049 --> 00:38:57,609
Hello, ma'am.

1000
00:38:59,290 --> 00:39:00,049
How did you do it?

1001
00:39:00,490 --> 00:39:02,129
A client introduced me to Xiuyuan.

1002
00:39:02,529 --> 00:39:04,049
He had a partnership with the inn

1003
00:39:04,049 --> 00:39:04,609
up there,

1004
00:39:04,609 --> 00:39:05,930
so I played along

1005
00:39:05,970 --> 00:39:07,490
and helped him organize that lecture.

1006
00:39:09,490 --> 00:39:10,729
Which helped your mom

1007
00:39:10,770 --> 00:39:11,810
see the truth about him.

1008
00:39:13,049 --> 00:39:13,450
So,

1009
00:39:13,770 --> 00:39:14,649
did you two

1010
00:39:14,930 --> 00:39:15,729
plan all of this

1011
00:39:15,729 --> 00:39:16,569
behind my back?

1012
00:39:16,970 --> 00:39:17,609
No, Mom!

1013
00:39:17,970 --> 00:39:18,609
Absolutely not!

1014
00:39:30,410 --> 00:39:31,089
Hello, Ms. Xu.

1015
00:39:31,529 --> 00:39:32,089
Who are you?

1016
00:39:32,930 --> 00:39:33,569
I'm Lu Hui,

1017
00:39:33,609 --> 00:39:34,729
Mr. Di's maid.

1018
00:39:35,049 --> 00:39:36,010
Earlier this spring,

1019
00:39:36,010 --> 00:39:37,010
at a dinner you attended,

1020
00:39:37,370 --> 00:39:38,689
I gave Mr. Di sobering medicine.

1021
00:39:39,290 --> 00:39:40,649
You even asked me back then

1022
00:39:40,890 --> 00:39:42,010
if it was made domestically.

1023
00:39:43,049 --> 00:39:43,810
I remember now.

1024
00:39:44,729 --> 00:39:45,330
Why are you

1025
00:39:45,330 --> 00:39:46,169
at my front door?

1026
00:39:47,490 --> 00:39:48,569
To bring you something.

1027
00:39:49,249 --> 00:39:50,490
Mr. Di never told me

1028
00:39:50,529 --> 00:39:51,689
he was sending someone over.

1029
00:39:52,169 --> 00:39:52,930
And I specifically

1030
00:39:52,930 --> 00:39:53,890
instructed security

1031
00:39:54,209 --> 00:39:54,810
that we're not

1032
00:39:54,850 --> 00:39:56,129
having guests lately.

1033
00:39:56,129 --> 00:39:56,930
How did you get in?

1034
00:39:57,569 --> 00:39:58,810
You were hiring cleaners.

1035
00:39:59,249 --> 00:39:59,970
I applied,

1036
00:40:00,450 --> 00:40:01,529
and walked in openly.

1037
00:40:06,890 --> 00:40:08,169
You said you brought something?

1038
00:40:09,169 --> 00:40:09,970
What is it?

1039
00:40:10,450 --> 00:40:11,609
A chance.

1040
00:40:12,770 --> 00:40:14,049
Give the money to Yu Meng now.

1041
00:40:14,930 --> 00:40:16,209
Otherwise, think about

1042
00:40:16,410 --> 00:40:17,770
how much

1043
00:40:17,810 --> 00:40:18,770
the news of your divorce

1044
00:40:19,810 --> 00:40:21,049
will cost your listed company.

1045
00:40:21,770 --> 00:40:22,890
You barged into my home

1046
00:40:22,970 --> 00:40:23,930
just to spout nonsense?

1047
00:40:24,569 --> 00:40:25,450
I'm calling security!

1048
00:40:26,249 --> 00:40:26,970
Get out!

1049
00:40:29,529 --> 00:40:30,729
Take a look at these photos

1050
00:40:31,529 --> 00:40:32,770
to see if I'm talking nonsense.

1051
00:40:41,450 --> 00:40:42,089
You've been

1052
00:40:42,089 --> 00:40:42,930
stalking me

1053
00:40:43,689 --> 00:40:45,010
and sneaking pictures!

1054
00:40:45,010 --> 00:40:45,850
That's illegal.

1055
00:40:46,410 --> 00:40:47,089
I was just taking

1056
00:40:47,129 --> 00:40:48,209
a few landscape pictures.

1057
00:40:48,649 --> 00:40:49,970
You happened to be in the frame.

1058
00:40:50,970 --> 00:40:51,850
A few photos

1059
00:40:52,290 --> 00:40:53,169
don't tell anything,

1060
00:40:53,569 --> 00:40:55,169
much less prove anything.

1061
00:40:55,169 --> 00:40:56,129
At least, they prove

1062
00:40:56,129 --> 00:40:57,370
your marriage

1063
00:40:57,370 --> 00:40:58,290
is in crisis,

1064
00:40:58,569 --> 00:40:59,490
hanging by a thread.

1065
00:41:00,370 --> 00:41:01,330
You know very well

1066
00:41:02,209 --> 00:41:03,810
that rumors are enough to take down

1067
00:41:04,850 --> 00:41:05,770
a listed company.

1068
00:41:06,930 --> 00:41:08,129
Do you think your competitors

1069
00:41:09,209 --> 00:41:10,529
will pass on this opportunity?

1070
00:41:11,209 --> 00:41:12,330
You weren't sent by Di.

1071
00:41:12,529 --> 00:41:13,689
Don't you fear I'll tell him?

1072
00:41:14,450 --> 00:41:15,649
Of course, you can tell him.

1073
00:41:16,648 --> 00:41:17,770
But he doesn't get to

1074
00:41:17,810 --> 00:41:18,689
decide who I send

1075
00:41:19,609 --> 00:41:20,410
these photos to.

1076
00:41:26,523 --> 00:41:29,384
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

1077
00:41:30,010 --> 00:41:30,810
(Divorce Agreement)
I'll agree to the divorce,

1078
00:41:31,970 --> 00:41:34,290
only on my terms.

1079
00:41:34,729 --> 00:41:36,010
This is our draft

1080
00:41:36,410 --> 00:41:37,930
(Divorce Agreement)
of the divorce settlement.

1081
00:41:38,249 --> 00:41:39,129
Mr. Di demands

1082
00:41:39,129 --> 00:41:40,490
an equal split of marital assets,

1083
00:41:41,129 --> 00:41:41,890
while keeping

1084
00:41:41,890 --> 00:41:43,010
the luxury apartment

1085
00:41:43,649 --> 00:41:44,970
and half

1086
00:41:44,970 --> 00:41:45,810
of your Jiali shares.

1087
00:41:46,370 --> 00:41:47,450
(Jinghua Series Launch Countdown)
You missed a great chance

1088
00:41:47,529 --> 00:41:49,129
to share the fruits of victory.

1089
00:41:49,209 --> 00:41:50,209
(Live Online Sales)
If you'd signed the divorce

1090
00:41:50,209 --> 00:41:51,010
(Jinghua Shuiyue)
and bought back the stock,

1091
00:41:51,529 --> 00:41:53,089
you could've had a piece of this pie.

1092
00:41:54,010 --> 00:41:55,410
As long as we're still married,

1093
00:41:55,890 --> 00:41:57,010
half of your victory

1094
00:41:57,529 --> 00:41:58,770
will always belong to me.

1095
00:42:14,056 --> 00:42:18,925
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1096
00:42:21,409 --> 00:42:26,272
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1097
00:42:28,730 --> 00:42:33,575
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1098
00:42:34,020 --> 00:42:40,522
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1099
00:42:43,254 --> 00:42:50,207
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1100
00:42:50,757 --> 00:42:56,687
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

1101
00:42:57,811 --> 00:43:05,042
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1102
00:43:05,345 --> 00:43:10,518
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

1103
00:43:11,138 --> 00:43:22,606
♪In this life,
I follow only my own choice♪

1104
00:43:25,106 --> 00:43:30,354
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1105
00:43:32,395 --> 00:43:37,830
♪No need to echo those
who drifted apart♪

1106
00:43:39,652 --> 00:43:45,049
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1107
00:43:45,049 --> 00:43:53,694
♪The answer has long been etched
in my silhouette♪

1108
00:43:54,170 --> 00:44:01,733
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1109
00:44:01,733 --> 00:44:07,579
♪Paving every twist and turn
into a path forward♪

1110
00:44:07,579 --> 00:44:17,746
♪The ending of this life
will be set by me♪

